List of changes:
* Added a new kind of girls - cooks. They can be found in the kitchen of the bar. Their appearance and character are also randomly generated;
* Game laucher. In it you can change the parameters of the screen, sound and other things. While it may not work correctly;
* Changed the game economy. With enemies you can now get less money. The prices have also changed for the bartender;
*Now it is more difficult to abuzit dialogues. Girls respond more clearly to action;
* Added achievements;

Bug fixes:
* Fixed a bug due to the fact that he had to speak in dialogue with the enemy, as if he was a girl;
* Fixed a bug where sometimes the fog did not disappear after training;
* Fixed a bug due to which it was impossible to download the game from the main menu;

